# Cloudflare Pages redirects and rewrites. A status of 200 is a rewrite:
# the URL in the address bar stays as it is and the target file is served.

# Account-email links: https://tarkk.ir/v/<register|reset|email>#<token>.
# On a phone with Tark these open the app (Android App Links, verified by
# /.well-known/assetlinks.json) and never reach this host. Everywhere else
# one static page answers all three: website/v/index.html. The token rides
# in the #fragment, which a browser never sends in a request, so neither
# this rule nor the host ever sees it — and the page itself runs no script.
/v/register  /v/  200
/v/reset     /v/  200
/v/email     /v/  200
/v/register/ /v/  200
/v/reset/    /v/  200
/v/email/    /v/  200
